            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2009.12.012>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2017.0425> .

    <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bpj.2017.04.011> dcterms:date "2017"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dcterms:title "Long-term, stochastic editing of regenerative anatomy via targeting endogenous bioelectric gradients" .

    <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chembiol.2010.11.012> dcterms:date "2011"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dcterms:title "A bioelectric mechanism for H,K-ATPase-mediated control of anterior-posterior polarity in planarian regeneration" .

    <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2009.12.012> dcterms:date "2010"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dcterms:title "Long-range neural and gap junction protein-mediated cues control polarity during planarian regeneration" .

    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rsif.2017.0425> dcterms:date "2017"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dcterms:title "Bioelectric gene and reaction networks: computational modeling of genetic, biochemical, and bioelectrical dynamics in pattern regulation" .
